    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "ELI5",
      "items": [
        "Before this change a paragraph on the site could end with one word alone on its last line.",
        "Now every page asks the browser to choose line breaks that avoid that.",
        "Paragraphs read more evenly and no page gets longer; a browser that ignores the request shows the text as before."
      ]
    }
